        626.7852172851562,
        377.1893005371094,
        641.2282104492188
      ],
      "text": "treatment of microbiologically confirmed pulmonary MDR/RR-TB. 25",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        648.4891967773438,
        527.4178466796875,
        662.9321899414062
      ],
      "text": "The study was divided into two stages, with a seamless transition between the stages, meaning that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        661.6890869140625,
        527.3828125,
