      "text": "recruitment into an arm would only stop after a decision had been taken following stage 1 primary",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        674.8892211914062,
        527.4156494140625,
        689.3322143554688
      ],
      "text": "endpoint data analysis. In the first stage – equivalent to a Phase 2B trial of safety and preliminary",
